From 0cb2bfab80e8685e196991f2476337f2c8d1bfac Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Igor Grinberg <igrinberg@habana.ai>
Date: Sat, 22 May 2021 20:05:50 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-43025] fwupd: prepare for multiple instances

We are going to have multiple instances of the fwupd module, so we can
serve additional modules with fwupd interface.
To prepare for the addition, stop using the global variable all over and
switch to use/pass function parameter.
Additionally introduce operators for reading and writing the interface
registers - this is to virtualize the interface.

Change-Id: I6276cc0dedf93f8a3f7d039f7daae164cff4f99f
Signed-off-by: Igor Grinberg <igrinberg@habana.ai>
(cherry picked from commit 43e59c9aab0ace6f931ee8951dc4e5fee9ccd03d)
---

diff --git a/preboot/module_fwupd.c b/preboot/module_fwupd.c
index b00859b..2f26c49 100644
